159b71e7fb93a21b2d\">           <p><br></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:48px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">研究生课程：现代机器人系统及应用</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:48px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">本科生课程：人工智能技术及应用<br>智能机器人专题讲座<br>机器人驱动与运动控制<br>数字信号处理</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3203\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"1\" id=\"3203\">教学成果</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_icon_add\" title=\"添加\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_add\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><i class=\"part_icon_solid\"></i><a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"458541ad7b03863ed960546b273dbf5e\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"成果名称\">           成果名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"17c4167def4c2045b254d097e6cc4ca4\">           <ol class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal; padding-left:70px;\">            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">IEEE ARM 2017/最佳论文奖，Research on the Control Method for High Speed Locomotion Legged Robot,2017.08</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">水面垃圾清理机器人，第十三届国际水中机器人大赛/冠军，2020.09</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">蓝海引擎-赋能海洋观测装备续航的波浪能量收集器，中国研究生创新实践系列大赛-“车谷杯”第九届中国研究生能源装备创新设计大赛/一等奖和优秀指导教师，2022.12</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">蓝海创能--基于磁推旋转升频机制的高功率密度波浪能收集器，2024“秦创原-中石协·宝石机械杯”第十一届中国研究生能源装备创新设计大赛/一等奖优秀指导教师，2024.10</span></p></li>           </ol>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">招生信息</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"661cf3af91224177b7878fedac676bed\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"dea8a05a91bb4baa92d53a0f2d7e1e8d\">           <p><br></p>           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:宋体, SimSun;\">博士招生</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:宋体, SimSun;\">招收具身智能机器人、足式（人形）机器人、类脑智能、水下移动作业等方向的博士研究生。欢迎具有机械、自动化、控制、计算机、电子等专业背景，对足式机器人、具身智能、视觉SLAM、机器人作业与操作等方向有浓厚兴趣的同学报考。</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:宋体, SimSun;\"> </span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:宋体, SimSun;\">硕士招生</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:宋体, SimSun;\">招收具身智能机器人、足式（人形）机器人、类脑智能、水下移动作业等方向的硕士研究生（学术学位 / 专业学位）。欢迎踏实勤奋、具备较强动手能力与编程基础、对机器人科研有热情的同学加入课题组。</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>      </ul>     </div>     <div id=\"tabb8305part\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3101\"></i><em id=\"3101\" data-more=\"0\">论文期刊</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"7af8bea8bdd342e25449fe7297fcdc94\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"5e966be7b1416a723fe3b7af57045a90\">           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[1]</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Yu D, Zhang M, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">et al. Squeezing More Past Knowledge for Online Class-Incremental Continual Learning[J]. IEEE/CAA Journal of Automatica Sinica, 2023, 10(3): 722-736.</span><span sty