based pre-training method for reinforcement learning of peg-in-hole tasks[J]. IEEE Robotics and Automation Letters, 2023, 8(6): 3478-3485.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(影响因子：</span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">5.3</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">).</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[12]</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Shi Y, Li M, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, et al. Force-controlled compensation scheme for P</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Q valve-controlled asymmetric cylinder used on hydraulic quadruped robots[J]. Journal of Bionic Engineering, 2020, 17: 1139-1151.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(影响因子：4.9)</span></span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[13]</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zhang T, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, Wang X, et al. Walk2Run: A Bio-Rhythm-Inspired Unified Control Framework for Humanoid Robot Walking and Running[J]. Journal of Bionic Engineering, 2025, 22(6): 2849-2863.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(影响因子：</span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">4.4</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[14]</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zhang L, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, Guo W, et al. An Integrated Framework for Slip Detection and Recovery in Hexapod Robot Force Control[J]. Journal of Bionic Engineering, 2026, 23(2): 638-651.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(影响因子：</span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">4.4</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[15]</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zhang L, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, Zha F, et al. HiLoMa: Hierarchical Loco-Manipulation Control for Quadruped Manipulators with Coordinated Planning and Dynamic Coupling Compensation: L. Zhang et al[J]. Journal of Bionic Engineering, 2026: 1-18.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(影响因子：</span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">4.4</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[16]</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Wang X, Zhang T, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, et al. Humanoid Robot Jumping Control Based on Centroid Trajectory and Sparse Key Limb Pose Guidance[J]. Journal of Bionic Engineering, 2026: 1-17.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(影响因子：</span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">4.4</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[17]</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Chen G,</span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> Zha F*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> ,Zhang T, et al. Biomimetic Stable Walking of Bipedal Robots Based on 3D Divergent Component of Motion[J]. Journal of Bionic Engineering, 2026: 1-22.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(影响因子：</span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">4.4</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[18]</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Yuan J, Guo W, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">et al. Reinforcement Learning Navigation for Robots Based on Hippocampus Episode Cognition[J]. Journal of Bionic Engineering, 2024, 21(1): 288-302.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(影响因子：4.</span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[19]</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Yuan J, Guo W,</span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">Zha F*</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> et al. Robot navigation strategy in complex environment based on episode cognition[J]. Journal of Bionic Engineering, 2023, 20(1): 1-15.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(影响因子：4.</span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[20]</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Wang X, Guo W, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, Sun L. Bionic Jumping of Humanoid Robot via Online Centroid Trajectory Optimization and High Dynamic Motion Controller[J]. Journal of Bionic Engineering, 2024: 1-20.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(影响因子：4.</span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3301\"></i><em data-editor=\"0\" data-more=\"1\" id=\"3301\">出版物</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_icon_add\" title=\"添加\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_add\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><i class=\"part_icon_solid\"></i><a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl>        <ol id=\"0ec0277d4be272b43f4548b11086312e\" style=\"padding-left:70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"出版物名称\">           出版物名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           神经元模型与听觉信息处理978-7-03-074694-8          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"author\" data-zh=\"作者\">           作者          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           孙立宁、查富生、高娃等          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"publication time\" data-zh=\"出版时间\">           出版时间          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           2024.06          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"press\" data-zh=\"出版社\">           出版社          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           科学出版社          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"\" data-domtype=\"textarea\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"introduction\" data-zh=\"简单介绍\">           简单介绍          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>     </ul>     </div>     <div id=\"4c4cb2f587d6289bae96089cd64f6531part\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">Profile Information</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"e1b8af769e6c1972a8bad33292661421\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"bbd1e112d53b3f9e1aa38c463385bc29\">           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Fusheng Zha, male, born in 1974. Professor and doctoral supervisor. His research focuses on artificial intelligence, legged robots, visual SLAM, mobile manipulators, and related fields.</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Over the past five years, he has led seven national-level projects, including an open-competition humanoid robotics project of the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology and a subproject of a major </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">National Natural Science Foundation of China</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">project; he has also participated in nine national-level projects, including an NSFC Innovative Research Group project, a high-quality development program of the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology, and National Key R&amp;D Program projects. His research funding has exceeded RMB 50 million.</span></span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">He has published one monograph and more than 100 papers, including over 50 indexed by SCI and over 40 indexed by EI; he holds more than 20 authorized national invention patents. He has received one First Prize and one Second Prize of the Heilongjiang Provincial Science and Technology Award, as well as one Second Prize of the Heilongjiang Provincial Science and Technology Progress Award.</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">Education</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"c0849ca4a6f131a0bf376e6d550f1002\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"1cfe42fa3dcb0cf87080e8d96980d144\">           <p style=\"margin-left:48px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol; font-size:13px;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-size-adjust:none; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:9px; font-family:'Times New Roman';\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">2005.03 — 2012.06 Harbin Institute of Technology, Ph.D. in Mechatronics Engineering</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:48px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol; font-size:13px;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-size-adjust:none; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:9px; font-family:'Times New Roman';\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">2002.09 — 2005.03 Lanzhou University of Technology, M.S. in Mechanical Design and Theory</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">Employment</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"cdfc56ceb358b42bed57fe11ec578170\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"a63ce860f92f3aef0be18b9c1555b357\">           <p style=\"margin-left:48px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol; font-size:13px;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-size-adjust:none; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:9px; font-family:'Times New Roman';\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">2024.12 — Present Professor, School of Mechatronics Engineering, Harbin Institute of Technology</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:48px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol; font-size:13px;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-size-adjust:none; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:9px; font-family:'Times New Roman';\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">2016.12 — 2024.12 Associate Professor, School of Mechatronics Engineering, Harbin Institute of Technology (Doctoral Supervisor since 2020.07)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:48px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol; font-size:13px;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-size-adjust:none; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:9px; font-family:'Times New Roman';\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">2009.01 — 2016.12 Lecturer, School of Mechatronics Engineering, Harbin Institute of Technology</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>     </ul>    </div>    <div id=\"a512a5b7b0377fcf77a43ec32b05f0c8part\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">Main Research Areas</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"39a4bec206b05190993084b6f94f29c5\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"f2b5f47b8a74e730bb67e71b53def6e1\">           <p style=\"margin-left:48px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol; font-size:13px;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-size-adjust:none; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:9px; font-family:'Times New Roman';\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">1. Biomimetic and Embodied Intelligent Systems</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Legged robots (humanoid, quadruped, and hexapod robots), highly dynamic biomimetic control systems, and adaptive locomotion control in complex environments.</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:48px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol; font-size:13px;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-size-adjust:none; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:9px; font-family:'Times New Roman';\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">2. Embodied Vision and Autonomous Perception and Decision-Making</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Cooperative path planning for heterogeneous multi-robot systems, visual perception and navigation mapping, and vision-language navigation.</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:48px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol; font-size:13px;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-size-adjust:none; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:9px; font-family:'Times New Roman';\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">3. Humanlike Manipulation and Autonomous Operation</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Mobile manipulators, humanlike grasping and intuitive-physics-based manipulation decision-making, and coordinated dual-arm manipulation.</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:48px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol; font-size:13px;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-size-adjust:none; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:9px; font-family:'Times New Roman';\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">4. Underwater Robotics Technologies and Applications</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Autonomous underwater target recognition and pose estimation, underwater manipulator control, and dynamic-to-dynamic docking of unmanned underwater vehicles.</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">Research Projects</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"8f1f24240e46174bb7a457c839a91e9a\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"38677f41772602dac57f4d8e36b2436d\">           <p style=\"margin-left:24px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">1. Principal Investigator, </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">National-level </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Science and Technology Innovation Project, 2018.12-2020.12, funding: RMB 3.5 million</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">;</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:24px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">. Principal Investigator, Key Technologies for Biomimetic Perception, Learning, Manipulation, and Intelligent Multi-Robot Collaboration</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(</span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">NSFC Joint Fund</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, 2021.01-2024.12, funding: RMB 2.158 million;</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:24px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">3. Principal Investigator, </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Humanoid Robot </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Control </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Technology Development</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(</span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">2023 Open Competition </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Suzhou </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Major Incubation Project</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, 2023.09-2026.09, funding: RMB </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">2.5</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">million;</span></span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:24px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">. Principal Investigator, Development, Testing, and Validation of Humanoid Robot Motion Control Algorithms, 2024.01-2024.12, funding: RMB 2.2 million;</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:24px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">. Principal Investigator, Whole-Body Dynamics Control Algorithms for Highly Dynamic Humanoid Robot Motion</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(</span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">2023 Open Competition Project of the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, 2024.01-2025.12, funding: RMB 23 million;</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:24px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">. Principal Investigator, Design and Development of a Special-Purpose Hexapod Robot Prototype, 2025.04-2027.04, funding: RMB 6 million;</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:24px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">7. Principal Investigator, Development of Neuro-Regulated Real-Time Cerebellar Control Technology for Highly Dynamic Humanoid Robot Motion (Suzhou Science and Technology Research Project / Suzhou Key Core Technology Project), 2025.07-2028.06, funding: RMB 1 million;</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:24px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">8. Principal Investigator, </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Development of Key Lining-Ramming Processes and Supporting Intelligent Equipment for Aluminum Electrolysis Cells</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(</span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">National Demonstration Zone Science and Technology Development Plan</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, 2026.04-2028.04, funding: RMB </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">1.35</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">million;</span></span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:24px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">9. Principal Investigator, Operating-Condition Perception, Motion-Accuracy Control, and Autonomous Process Decision-Making for Embodied-Intelligence Welding Robots in Semi-Enclosed Three-Dimensional Segmented Application Scenarios (Open Competition Science and Technology Innovation Project), 2026.07-2027.12, funding: RMB 1.5 million;</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:24px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Participant, </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">NSFC Innovative Research Group Project</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">— </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Fundamental Theories and Key Technologies of Robotics</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">2016</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">.01-2021.12</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, funding: RMB </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">million</span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">.</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">Awards and Honors</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"53f37336d3de8956ea73dbf0302baefd\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"9ac04f41f14b808437e3821742b9c097\">           <p style=\"margin-left:48px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol; font-size:13px;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-size-adjust:none; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:9px; font-family:'Times New Roman';\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Key Technologies and Applications of Mobile Manipulator Systems</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:24px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">Fusheng Zha (7th-ranked contributor)</span></span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:24px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">First Prize, Heilongjiang Provincial Science and Technology Award</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:48px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol; font-size:13px;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-size-adjust:none; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:9px; font-family:'Times New Roman';\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Miniature Mobile Robot for Precision MEMS Operations</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:24px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">Fusheng Zha (8th-ranked contributor)</span></span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:24px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Second Prize, Heilongjiang Provincial Science and Technology Award</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:48px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol; font-size:13px;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-size-adjust:none; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:9px; font-family:'Times New Roman';\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Miniature Mobile Robot for Precision MEMS Operations</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:48px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Fusheng Zha (8th-ranked contributor)</span></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Second Prize, Heilongjiang Provincial Science and Technology Progress Award</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">Patents</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"9dcadc9aeba61679f7ec55d793b0d93c\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"fb6ab618f19bfd5be6f2937948745415\">           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">1. Visual Navigation System for Legged Robots in Unstructured Environments</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Fusheng Zha, Teng Zhang, Jianan Xu, Zijun Sun, Wei Guo, Lining Sun, Pengfei Wang</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">2. High-Dynamic Jumping Motion Control Method for Humanoid Robots Based on Online Center-of-Mass Trajectory Optimization</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Fusheng Zha, Xiangji Wang, Shilin He, Wei Guo, Pengfei Wang, Lining Sun</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">3. Underwater Manipulator Operation System Based on a Large Foldable-Deployable Configuration</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Fusheng Zha, Qiming Wang, Yuanjie Liu, Wei Guo, Pengfei Wang, Jinrui Zhou, Chuanyuan Li</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">4. 6-DoF Robotic Arm Grasping Method Based on Shape Features</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Fusheng Zha, Yaofeng Cheng, Wei Guo, Pengfei Wang, Shengkai Liu, Chi Zhang, Lining Sun</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">5. Task-Oriented Robotic Arm Grasping Method Based on Intuitive Physics</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Fusheng Zha, Yaofeng Cheng, Shengkai Liu, Teng Zhang, Wei Guo, Pengfei Wang, Lining Sun</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">6. Efficient Sparse Convolution Method and System for Event Camera Data</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Fusheng Zha, Sen Zhang, Yaofeng Cheng, Shengkai Liu, Wei Guo, Lining Sun, Pengfei Wang</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">7. Method for Constructing Dark-Room SLAM Based on Biomimetic Perception Fusion</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Fusheng Zha, Jinsheng Yuan, Wei Guo, Mantian Li, Lining Sun, Pengfei Wang</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">8. Prosthetic Robotic Finger</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Fusheng Zha, Xiaobo Li, Wei Guo, Pengfei Wang, Mantian Li, Lining Sun</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">9. Deployment and Recovery Device for an Unmanned Underwater Vehicle</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Fusheng Zha, Wei Guo, Pengfei Wang, Mantian Li, Jihong Wen, Jianguo Tao</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">10. Multi-Section Three-Parallel-Mechanism Robotic Arm Device with Automatic Extension and Retraction</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Fusheng Zha, Wei Guo, Pengfei Wang, Mantian Li, Jihong Wen, Jianguo Tao</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>     </ul>    </div>    <div id=\"50e276a187d88a87ae651265af2fe5f7part\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">Courses Taught</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"bc9130c7c258c8dcdfe019bdeb6dfd35\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"46b3c35f08f5dec6c4cf875257c8c880\">           <p style=\"margin-left:48px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol; font-size:13px;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-size-adjust:none; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:9px; font-family:'Times New Roman';\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Graduate Course: Modern Robotic Systems and Applications</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:48px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol; font-size:13px;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-size-adjust:none; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:9px; font-family:'Times New Roman';\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Undergraduate Courses: Artificial Intelligence Technology and Applications; </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Special Topics in Intelligent Robotics; </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Robot Actuation and Motion Control; </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Digital Signal Processing</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">Teaching Achievements</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"fd8218192ff9eac85cc82d344864847e\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"0fe9dd4de37b3d4621b6f661ac51a034\">           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">1. IEEE ARM 2017 / Best Paper Award, Research on the Control Method for High Speed Locomotion Legged Robot, 2017.08</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">2. Surface-Water Waste-Cleaning Robot, 13th International Underwater Robot Contest / Champion, 2020.09</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">3. Blue Ocean Engine - A Wave Energy Harvester for Extending the Endurance of Ocean Observation Equipment, China Graduate Innovation and Practice Competition Series - 'Chegu Cup' 9th China Graduate Energy Equipment Innovation Design Competition / First Prize and Outstanding Advisor, 2022.12</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">4. Blue Ocean Innovation - A High-Power-Density Wave Energy Harvester Based on a Magnetic-Repulsion Rotary Frequency-Boosting Mechanism, 2024 'Qinchuangyuan - China Petroleum and Petrochemical Equipment Industry Association · BOMCO Cup' 11th China Graduate Energy Equipment Innovation Design Competition / First Prize and Outstanding Advisor, 2024.10</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">Admissions</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"cafce28abb9650daccc3a15f7a4a2a23\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"2f7a0860462a8f22a45aeb91cb82a60a\">           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Doctoral Admissions</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">We recruit </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">students in embodied-intelligence robotics, legged (humanoid) robotics, brain-inspired intelligence, and underwater mobile manipulation</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">at the doctoral level. Applicants with backgrounds in mechanical engineering, automation, control, computer science, electronics, or related disciplines who have a strong interest in legged robots, embodied intelligence, visual SLAM, and robotic operation and manipulation are welcome to apply.</span></span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> </span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Master's Admissions</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">We recruit </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">students in embodied-intelligence robotics, legged (humanoid) robotics, brain-inspired intelligence, and underwater mobile manipulation</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">in academic or professional master's programs. Students who are diligent, have strong hands-on skills and a solid programming foundation, and are passionate about ro</span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">botics research are welcome to join our research group.</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>     </ul>    </div>    <div id=\"1ea385500b8add09c7f9a091cec559f3part\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display: block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">International Journal Articles</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"431af8ba04c1c7e3304cc671718bd73e\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"d7035dbdb8b2e1214375a2b00257859e\">           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[1] </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Yu D, Zhang M, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">et al. Squeezing More Past Knowledge for Online Class-Incremental Continual Learning[J]. IEEE/CAA Journal of Automatica Sinica, 2023, 10(3): 722-736.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(Impact Factor: </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">18.3</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[2] </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Tang T, Li Y, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, et al. Ultra-low-frequency and high-power Mag-Boost mechanism for ocean wave energy harvesting[J]. Renewable and Sustainable Energy Reviews, 2025, 213: 115463.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(Impact Factor: </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">18</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[3] </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Li Y, Huang M, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, et al. A high-power non-contact magnetic conversion-enhanced wind energy harvester for self-powered iot nodes and real-time wind speed sensing[J]. Nano Energy, 2025, 143: 111293.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(Impact Factor: </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">16.7</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[4] </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Yu D, Zhang M,</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> et al. Contrastive correlation preserving replay for online continual learning[J]. IEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology, 2023, 34(1): 124-139.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">(Impact Factor: </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">10.8</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[5] </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Tang T, Zhao H, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, et al. Double-stage frequency-boost mechanism for high-power wave energy harvesting from ultra-low frequency ocean excitations[J]. Renewable Energy, 2025: 124183.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(Impact Factor: </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">9.1</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[6] </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> Cheng Y, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, Guo W, et al. PCF-Grasp: Converting Point Completion to Geometry Feature to Enhance 6-DoF Grasp</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:等线; font-size:16px; text-decoration:none;\">[J]. </span><a href=\"https://www.letpub.com.cn/index.php?page=journalapp&amp;view=detail&amp;journalid=9471\" style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px; color:rgb(0, 0, 0);\">IEEE Transactions on Systems Man Cybernetics-Systems</span></a><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration:none;\">, 202</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">5, 56(1): 617-628. <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(Impact Factor: </span>8.4)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[7] </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Li M, Yang Z, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, et al. Design and analysis of a whole-body controller for a velocity controlled robot mobile manipulator[J]. Science China Information Sciences, 2020, 63: 1-15.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(Impact Factor: 8</span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">.1</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[8] </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Sheng W, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, Guo W,</span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">et al. Finite class Bayesian inference system for circle and linear walking gait event recognition using inertial measurement units[J]. IEEE Transactions on Neural Systems and Rehabilitation Engineering, 2020, 28(12): 2869-2879.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(Impact Factor: </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">6.6</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[9] </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Gao J, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, Zhang L, et al. HR</span><sup><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">2</span></sup><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> -KILO: A High-Rate, Robust, Kinematic-Inertial-LiDAR Odometry for Humanoid Robots[J]. IEEE Robotics and Automation Letters, 2025.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(Impact Factor: </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">5.3</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[10] </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Cheng Y, Liu S, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, et al. A2G: Leveraging Intuitive Physics for Force-Efficient Robotic Grasping[J]. IEEE Robotics and Automation Letters, 2024.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">(Impact Factor: </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">5.3</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[11] </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zang Y, Wang P, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, et al. Geometric-feature representation based pre-training method for reinforcement learning of peg-in-hole tasks[J]. IEEE Robotics and Automation Letters, 2023, 8(6): 3478-3485.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(Impact Factor: </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">5.3</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">).</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[12] </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Shi Y, Li M, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, et al. Force-controlled compensation scheme for P</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Q valve-controlled asymmetric cylinder used on hydraulic quadruped robots[J]. Journal of Bionic Engineering, 2020, 17: 1139-1151.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(Impact Factor: 4.9)</span></span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[13] </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zhang T, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, Wang X, et al. Walk2Run: A Bio-Rhythm-Inspired Unified Control Framework for Humanoid Robot Walking and Running[J]. Journal of Bionic Engineering, 2025, 22(6): 2849-2863.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(Impact Factor: </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">4.4</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[14] </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zhang L, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, Guo W, et al. An Integrated Framework for Slip Detection and Recovery in Hexapod Robot Force Control[J]. Journal of Bionic Engineering, 2026, 23(2): 638-651.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(Impact Factor: </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">4.4</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[15] </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zhang L, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, Zha F, et al. HiLoMa: Hierarchical Loco-Manipulation Control for Quadruped Manipulators with Coordinated Planning and Dynamic Coupling Compensation: L. Zhang et al[J]. Journal of Bionic Engineering, 2026: 1-18.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(Impact Factor: </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">4.4</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[16] </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Wang X, Zhang T, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, et al. Humanoid Robot Jumping Control Based on Centroid Trajectory and Sparse Key Limb Pose Guidance[J]. Journal of Bionic Engineering, 2026: 1-17.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(Impact Factor: </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">4.4</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[17] </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Chen G,</span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> Zha F*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> ,Zhang T, et al. Biomimetic Stable Walking of Bipedal Robots Based on 3D Divergent Component of Motion[J]. Journal of Bionic Engineering, 2026: 1-22.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(Impact Factor: </span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">4.4</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[18] </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Yuan J, Guo W, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">et al. Reinforcement Learning Navigation for Robots Based on Hippocampus Episode Cognition[J]. Journal of Bionic Engineering, 2024, 21(1): 288-302.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(Impact Factor: 4.</span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[19] </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Yuan J, Guo W,</span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">Zha F*</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> et al. Robot navigation strategy in complex environment based on episode cognition[J]. Journal of Bionic Engineering, 2023, 20(1): 1-15.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(Impact Factor: 4.</span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-left:29px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:16px;\">[20] </span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Wang X, Guo W, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Zha F</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">*</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">, Sun L. Bionic Jumping of Humanoid Robot via Online Centroid Trajectory Optimization and High Dynamic Motion Controller[J]. Journal of Bionic Engineering, 2024: 1-20.</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family:等线;\">(Impact Factor: 4.</span></span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">)</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display: block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">Book</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"fa8226f1c3e98b38aaf93c50d1c6558a\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"0d116450d1a74976d2a005c53da062de\">           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Title: Neuron Models and Auditory Information Processing, ISBN 978-7-03-074694-8</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Authors: Lining Sun, Fusheng Zha, Gaowa, et al.</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:等线; font-size:16px;\">Publication Date: 2024.06</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:20px\"><span style